uede is made from the underside of the hide and is softer and more delicate. Nubuck is the outer side, lightly sanded, so it is tougher but shows marks in the same way."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What size bag do I need for a weekend away?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "For two nights, a weekender of 30 to 40 litres, roughly 50 cm long, holds clothes, a second pair of shoes and a wash bag. The capacity planner above adjusts this for longer trips and colder weather."}}]}]}</script>
